1.5 - Saturday 27 September 2014
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

- Fixed: Updated copyright dates in NOTICE files.
- Remove custom test runner.
- Enabled 2 test cases (11 tests) in Archive component
- Added composer.json
- Added Travis config
- Fixed wrongly decoded TAR archive headers with PHP 5.5
- Fixed #ZETACOMP-8: Double extraction causes empty file. (Patch by Patrick
  Alaert).


